WEBVTT

1
00:00:10,960 --> 00:00:13,960
And the temperature in the room was a bit cold

2
00:00:13,960 --> 00:00:15,960
Now I actually feel it completely

3
00:00:15,960 --> 00:00:17,960
You have acquired the skill Frost Master

4
00:00:17,960 --> 00:00:20,660
Honey, you look so strong

5
00:00:20,660 --> 00:00:21,660
Very practical

6
00:00:21,660 --> 00:00:23,700
In this water-scarce world

7
00:00:23,700 --> 00:00:25,860
Can make ice out of thin air

8
00:00:25,860 --> 00:00:27,860
It’s like having unlimited water source

9
00:00:27,860 --> 00:00:30,050
Not to mention the ability to combine offense and defense

10
00:00:30,050 --> 00:00:34,060
Condensation speed is extremely fast

11
00:00:34,060 --> 00:00:39,080
In actual combat, you can definitely catch the enemy by surprise.

12
00:00:39,080 --> 00:00:40,080
Gather such a small ice pick

13
00:00:40,080 --> 00:00:42,880
It only consumed nine points of physical strength.

14
00:00:42,880 --> 00:00:43,880
The consumption is really not low

15
00:00:43,880 --> 00:00:49,980
This ice shield directly drained my energy.
